flowchart LR
    Input[Input bytes] --> Engine[TitanEngine]
    Engine --> Decoders[Decoders]
    Engine --> Analyzers[Analyzers]
    Decoders --> Graph[Artifact graph]
    Analyzers --> Graph
    Graph --> IOC[IOC extraction]
    Graph --> Detection[Detections]
    IOC --> Detection
    Detection --> Risk[Risk scoring]
    Graph --> Intelligence[Intelligence Layer]
    IOC --> Intelligence
    Detection --> Intelligence
    Risk --> Intelligence
    Intelligence --> Outputs[Reports and graph exports]
